forgepilot-example: stat-fix-reporting

This marker exists so `prepare_repo.py` can tell "a checkout I made earlier, safe
to recreate" from "a directory someone else is using, hands off". It is committed
into the fixture's initial commit, so it travels with the repository.

Do not remove it from a prepared checkout — `prepare_repo.py` will then refuse to
reset that directory, which is the safe failure but a confusing one.
